title: Credits

Many works were referenced in the making of this game. In addition, many features invented by fellow developers have been used in accordance with their consent.

- @books: Books
- @articles: Articles
- @images: Image sources
- @music: Music sources
- @ai: AI usage in the making of the game.
- @dev: Special thanks.
