@dev

Special thanks to Autumn Chen for:
<br> The inspiration for the whole project with her game "Social Democracy: An Alternate History"!
<br> Showing that history can be fun for the average person if taught in an interactive and visually appealing way. This is a vision that I tried to emulate in my own project too.

Special thanks to Communist45 for:
<br> Assistance throughout much of the development with their expertise in coding
<br> The code for the different kinds of tooltips
<br> Being a good friend in general

Special thanks to originn(aka the modman) for:
<br> Help with the parliament chart generation
<br> Help with adjusting the panel sizes
<br> Being an inspiration for many developers including myself with the breakthroughs of the dynamic SDAAH mod

Special thanks to placedstone for:
<br> Inspiration for the placement of the game's banner in the opening screen
<be> Inspiration for the design of the diplomacy tab during the Cyprus Minigame

Special thanks to Monsieur Atatürk for:
<br> His assistance with historical accuracy and realism
<br> Help in the design of the government cards
<br> Being a good friend in general

Special thanks to Umuth for:
<br> His advices on the css and UI
<br> Concepts for party cards and intra-party content
<br> Being a good friend in general

Special thanks to Sofia for:
<br> Making the banner of the game

